            <title>[LU-21223] sanity-quota test_84: dd succeed, expect EDQUOT after quota reset on ZFS</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21223</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Patrickbot &amp;lt;patrick-bot@mulberrytree.us&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/47ccb8eb-048d-4b8b-980c-7a8680af3177" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/47ccb8eb-048d-4b8b-980c-7a8680af3177&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_84 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;dd succeed, expect EDQUOT
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Client&lt;br/&gt;
Lustre: 2.17.61.87&lt;br/&gt;
Branch: master&lt;br/&gt;
Build: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/136343" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/136343&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Kernel: 4.18.0-553.177.1.el8_10.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Server&lt;br/&gt;
Lustre: 2.17.61.87&lt;br/&gt;
Branch: master&lt;br/&gt;
Build: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/136343" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/136343&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Kernel: 4.18.0-553.177.1.el8_10_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;sanity-quota test_84 (ZFS) fails intermittently with "dd succeed, expect EDQUOT": the final 200M direct write by the quota user succeeds after the group block hardlimit was set to 100M, so the limit was not enforced yet.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Failed: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/edfa7e35-2e5c-4e6a-8ba6-6be94858ea83" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/edfa7e35-2e5c-4e6a-8ba6-6be94858ea83&lt;/a&gt; (review-zfs, el8.10, master d6be6e4efe66, &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/70472" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/70472&lt;/a&gt;). Same error on 2026-11-04 on change 70348 (review-dne-zfs-part-4, session 91f5d673-2231-45da-b3f7-1676f403ae05). Rate is low: 2 failures in about 6500 lustre-reviews runs in 30 days; master-next full-part-2 also failed test_84 3 times in the last 10 days with other messages (dd failed, expect succeed; set user quota failed; setup quota failed).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The OST dmesg of the failing run, just before the failure, shows:&lt;br/&gt;
  qqi_reint_delayed()) lustre-OST0001: Delaying reintegration for qtype:0 until pending updates are flushed.&lt;br/&gt;
  qsd_req_completion()) DQACQ failed with -22 ... qtype:grp id:63 enforced:0 ... default:yes&lt;br/&gt;
So the group lqe on the OST was still enforced:0 when dd ran. The test sets "-B 100M" right after clearing and resetting quota (OBD_FAIL_QUOTA_GRANT, setquota -r) and runs dd with no wait_quota_synced on the new limit.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is not &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18646" title="ost-pools test_23b: FAIL: dd didn't fail with ENOSPC (26214400 &amp;gt; 22639616)" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18646"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18646&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (Resolved, fix 57871 in the tested tree: ZFS dd not consuming space, fixed by using /dev/urandom); the symptom string is the same but the cause here is quota reintegration/sync timing. The patch under test (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21060" title="Client-side per-job statistics for OSC, MDC and llite" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-21060"&gt;LU-21060&lt;/a&gt; jobstats split) does not touch quota.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-70472-ps3-8188f76fa8b3 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/70472" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/70472&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt;VVVVVVV DO NOT REMOVE LINES BELOW, Added by Maloo for auto-association VVVVVVV&lt;br/&gt;
sanity-quota test_84 - dd succeed, expect EDQUOT&lt;/p&gt;</description>
